  "80 too many open files",
  "81 sources nested too deeply",
  "82 arguments too long",
  "83 file name too long",
  "84 too many directories",
  "85 too many variables in one function",
  "86 too many initial values",
  "87 too much constant data in one table",
  "99 compiler error",
  "100 a call of this function inside its own arguments: use a variable",
  "110 \"to\", \"downto\" or \"until\" expected",
